<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Wednesday:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,550.30 (1,566.50)	CHF  1,066.70 (1,080.60)</p>
<p>    DEM    907.88 (920.93)	  GBP  2,535.40 (2,558.70)</p>
<p>    ATS    129.02 (130.64)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Tuesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $21.23 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$19.60 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $40.83 million ($38.17 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
